# 66. Implementation Order

---

# 1. Purpose

This document defines the recommended implementation sequence for the Loyalty Platform.

Its objective is to:

- minimize implementation risk;
- maximize parallel development;
- reduce cross-module dependencies;
- provide predictable delivery;
- optimize AI agent utilization;
- establish implementation milestones.

This document complements the Development Roadmap by defining the practical execution order.

---

# 2. Principles

Implementation follows these principles:

- Foundation before Features
- Stable Contracts before Integrations
- Domain before UI
- Backend before Frontend
- Events before Automation
- Security before Exposure
- Testing before Release
- Documentation before Completion

No implementation phase may violate module dependencies.

---

